in today's video we will be explaining  all muzan's forms in demon slayer we  will start with his weakest human form  but in the later parts of the video we  will be covering his most powerful demon  lord forms it's weird to think that the  main antagonist of the series and the  demon king himself muzan kibutsuji was  actually a human once muzon was born as  a human baby during the haiyan era in  the early 900s it was stated in the  manga that in his mother's womb his  heart has stopped several times when he  was born his heart was not beating and  he had no pulse at all it was decided  that he would be cremated but that's  when muzon cried for the first time  showing signs of life growing up the  doctors told him about his rare  condition and that he probably wouldn't  live past his twenties not giving up on  him the doctor of treating muzon gave  him a special prototype medicine that  was never used before due to the  medicine effect muzon's condition  suddenly got worse and in a rage he  killed the doctor that was treating him  suddenly he realized that the medicine  started working and that it helped him  get a healthier and stronger body but at  the cost of becoming the first ever  demon with an urge to eat humans with  that one out of the way we can start  covering much more interesting forms  demon form when he first became a demon  muzon was faced with many different  challenges apart from needing to eat  humans to stay alive which he wasn't  bothered by he discovered that he was  unable to walk in the sunlight as doing  so burned him severely muzon saw this as  a serious problem and regretted killing  the doctor that was treating him before  he could finish his treatment on muzon  he remembered that the doctor was using  the rare blue spider lily flower as  medicine and decided to find the flower  himself he then went on to search the  entire country for the flower but  couldn't find it deeply troubled by the  fact that he couldn't find the flower he  started to create more demons and plan  to spread them in the world hoping that  someday one of them would eventually  find a way to overcome the sun he  discovered that by giving humans a small  amount of his blood he could make them  into demons muzon can also further  empower a demon by giving him more of  his blood enhancing their pre-existing  abilities however this is limited to how  much blood the recipient can withstand  and adapt to if a human were to take in  too much blood from muzon their body  would mutate faster than they can  withstand causing them to self-destruct  into one giant mass of flesh before  disintegrating into ash he created many  strong demons over the years like  kugushibu kaza hantengu and gave them  titles of upper moons as part of the 12  kizuki being the first demon in  existence he is by far the strongest  demon in the world and has developed  many different abilities over the years  one of the things that makes him the  king of demons is his demon curse  ability he possesses the ability to put  a curse onto demons that have  assimilated his blood if any demon he  created even utters his name out loud  the curse activates and destroys them  regardless of their original intent this  was seen with susumaru who had  accidentally said his name despite  having no malice or ill intent towards  him and was still destroyed by the curse  implying that the curse is automatic  however the curse can also be  intentionally triggered by muzon this  was seen when he killed nakame who was  manipulated by yushiro because of this  many demons serve muzan out of fear and  respect simply referring to him as that  man when necessary to speak of him  however it has been proven that if muzan  is weakened or someone has sufficient  willpower demons can break free from the  curse which has been seen with tamayo  and nezuko he also has the ability to  read the thoughts of those that he has  shared his blood with by simply looking  at them it was later displayed that he  could also send telepathic messages and  have full conversations with other  demons as well as seen when he was  communicating with upper rank 1  kokushibo to check how many hashira he  had defeated and to order him to keep  them at bay until he finished recovering  from tamayo's poison muzon has also  stated he can sense the locations of all  demons he created however the further  away they are from him the harder it  will be for him to interact and track  them muzon is also able to see through  the senses of other demons however this  ability is limited strictly to what is  in their perception so if a demon's  senses are fooled muzon is unable to  discern the difference as well having  lived for over a millennia muzon is  extremely clever and erudite since he  has five fully functioning brains it  most likely boosts his intelligence and  other mental capabilities such as memory  and cognitive processing he was also  able to evade the demon slayer core for  nearly a thousand years despite the  leaders of the core the ubu yashiki  family possessing great foresight and  intuition and has also used demons to  create distractions somewhere far away  when he wants to hide something from the  core as far as his pure strength goes as  the demon king he is immeasurably strong  this was shown when he killed a grown  man with a single punch to the face  causing him to fly back as well as  hitting a building and causing cracks in  it he was also able to kill all lower  moon demons in his weakened woman form  with ease although he is already  insanely powerful his true strength is  unleashed when he enters his combat form  which we will cover very soon muscular  form the next one on the list is the  form that we got to see during a few  scenes only during the swordsmith  village arc muzon sends two of his upper  ranked demons kyoko and hantengu to the  village so they could kill tonjiro and  other demon slayers as the battle ends  nezuku almost disintegrates in the  sunlight but then suddenly becomes a  demon immune to the sun something that  muzon had tried to find for over a  millennia after telepathically gaining  this information from hantengu muzon  gets so excited that he instantly kills  his foster mother while calling nezuko  the chosen demon as he enters his  abnormal muscular form he also enters  this form when kagaya blows up his  mansion and tamayo injects him with  poison even though it is not officially  stated anywhere we believe that muzon  can enter this form when he gets very  excited or very angry we also believe  that his power doesn't increase in this  form it's only a physical change combat  form muzon's combat form is where the  true king of the demons awakens when  fighting muzon can adopt a more  monstrous form with a dark red mask  covering his limbs featuring sharp tooth  wide mouths with his torso exposed his  hair becomes longer and white his speed  strength reflexes and power are greatly  magnified in this form to the point that  despite having lost a great amount of  stamina and endurance and fending off  tomo's human transforming drug he was  still fully capable of easily  outmaneuvering several low-rank demon  slayers and consuming scores of them  within minutes of emerging from his  cocoon what makes his combat form so  different from his normal demon form is  his body being able to shapeshift he can  stretch his arms and grow several sharp  blades in his extended forearms and  shapeshift his hands into several bladed  protrusions which he could then swing  like whips to easily tear his opponents  to pieces the sheer swinging speed of  his attacks is extremely fast and the  precision of his attacks is also  extremely accurate even three hashira  working together couldn't get close to  him later upon being further enraged  muzong grows nine spine-like protrusions  from his bag that extend into bladed  whip-like tentacles with them muzon is  able to drastically increase his attack  range and number of attacks in tandem  with his whip arms allowing him to  easily mow down hordes of demon slayers  and corner for hashira furthermore it's  incredibly difficult to read the  trajectory of each whip making it nearly  impossible to counter muzon is also  tremendously fast in his combat form  possessing movement speed and reflexes  that surpass all the upper ranks of the  12 kizuki combined he was so fast that  tanjiro and mitsuri couldn't even see  them and could only rely on pure luck  and instinct to evade his attacks he was  also able to keep up with almost a dozen  hashira and ashira level demon slayers  for an extended period of time all at  once while having his power sapped due  to tamayo's drug he was near impossible  to beat in his combat form even with all  heshira powers combined if it weren't  for tamayo's anti-muson drug the entire  demon slayer core would be wiped out in  a matter of minutes in his final  struggle for survival muzon was able to  transfer the remainder of his blood  along with his memories into a suitable  body turning his new host into a demon  and exerting his influence he  successfully did this with tanjuro when  he was on the verge of death restoring  his damaged body and causing him to  rampage against his comrades furthermore  this technique is compatible with the  host's own abilities making it so tandro  can not only use demon abilities but  also his own as he gains immunity to  sunlight and potentially the use of the  sun breathing this transfer however is  not perfect as tondro was reduced to a  feral state only attacking based on  muzon's desire to kill the demon slayers  baby form muzon possesses the most  powerful and advanced shape-shifting  abilities out of all demons in existence  not only can muzon change his appearance  effortlessly but he can also change his  aura and presence which can even fool  the enhanced senses of lower ranked  demons as the long battle between musan  and the entire demon slayer core was  near end the sun was about to come out  at any minute as the last ditch to  survive muzon turned himself into a  giant demon-like baby trying to run away  in this form he could crush vehicles and  could only be held down by the combined  efforts of giome the heishiro with the  greatest physical strength and dozens of  other demon slayers although this form  is shown very briefly and there isn't  much information about it we thought  it's worth mentioning check out this  video where we explained all of nezuko's  forms in demon slayer

